  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New heating system - Slovensk&#xfd; evanjelick&#xfd; a.v. cirkevn&#xfd; zbor v B&#xe1;&#x10d;skej Palanky</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Nov&#xfd; syst&#xe9;m hriatia do chr&#xe1;mu Slovensk&#xfd; evanjelick&#xfd; a.v. cirkevn&#xfd; zbor v B&#xe1;&#x10d;skej Palanky</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Dot&#xe1;cia sa pou&#x17e;ije na zv&#xe1;dzanie hriatia do chr&#xe1;mu Bo&#x17e;ieho v ktorom sa nach&#xe1;dzaj&#xfa; dve star&#xe9; a nefunk&#x10d;n&#xe9; f&#xfa;ka&#x10d;ky ktor&#xe9; chr&#xe1;m nem&#xf4;&#x17e;u zohria&#x165;. Bude sa montova&#x165; dl&#xe1;&#x17e;kov&#xe9; hriatie, so syst&#xe9;mom ktor&#xfd; bude ekologickej&#x161;&#xed;, ekonomickej&#x161;&#xed; a efekt&#xed;vnej&#x161;&#xed; za dlhodob&#xe9; hriatie.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The grant will be used to heat the temple of God, which has two old and non-functioning blowers that cannot heat the temple. Underfloor heating will be installed, with a system that will be more ecological, more economical and more efficient for long-term heating.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
